<title>USA: UTI hires financial chief.</title>
<headline>UTI hires financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>UTI Energy Corp said Tuesday that P. Blake Dupuis has been appointed chief financial officer to succeed Anthony Mendicino, who resigned to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Dupuis has 21 years of financial experience, primarily in the energy industry.  Most recently, he served as chief financial officer of ADCOR-Nicklos Drilling Co, a Houston-based driller with 40 drilling rigs, UTI said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
